{"text": "Then the second son. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Went into the forest. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> With a cake and wine. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He also refused to share. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And his axe hit his leg. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then Simpleton said. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Father, let me go. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And cut wood. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> His father did not want him. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To go. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But Simpleton begged. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> His mother gave him. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> A cake baked in ashes. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And some sour beer. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The little gray old man. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Asked him for food, too. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Let us sit down. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And eat together. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Said Simpleton kindly. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Suddenly the cake was sweeter. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And the beer was now good wine. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> You have a good heart. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> So I will give you luck. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Cut down that old tree. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And look at its roots. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Simpleton cut it down. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And found a goose. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> With feathers of pure gold.", "alignment": {"characters": ["T", "h", "e", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "s", "e", "c", "o", "n", "d", " ", "s", "o", "n", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "W", "e", "n", "t", " ", "i", "n", "t", "o", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "f", "o", "r", "e", "s", "t", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "W", "i", "t", "h", " ", "a", " ", "c", "a", "k", "e", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "w", "i", "n", "e", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "H", "e", " ", "a", "l